            ("Which PM workflows can AI agents take on?", "Four stand out: backlog grooming (clustering, de-duplicating and drafting tickets), market research (tracking competitors and summarizing signals), experiment design (turning ideas into hypotheses and briefs) and KPI reviews (monitoring metrics and writing state of the product summaries)."),
            ("What still needs a product manager?", "Connecting work to strategy, deciding what to react to and what to ignore, choosing which experiments to run, judging which metrics matter, and saying no with a clear story for stakeholders."),
