            ("p", "The key mindset shift is this. Instead of thinking \"What can I ask an AI model for?\" think \"Which recurring ritual in my product practice can be supported or partly owned by an AI agent?\""),
            ("p", "A ritual is anything you do on a predictable cadence with a clear purpose. For example, weekly grooming, monthly KPI reviews, or quarterly strategy updates. These are perfect places to embed agents."),
            ("p", "Let us look at some \"before and after\" views."),
            ("h2", "1. Backlog grooming"),
